      "start_seconds": 1.15,
      "end_seconds": 4.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "Hello, sorry about the delay, do sit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 5.23,
      "end_seconds": 7.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "Hello, you know, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.57,
      "end_seconds": 9.77,
      "duration_seconds": 1.2,
      "text": "what's the problem?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.28,
      "end_seconds": 29.63,
      "duration_seconds": 18.35,
      "text": "Mm, it's an itchy patch on my wrist. I thought I'd wait, but it hasn't gone. I looked a few things up online, and that probably didn't help. Sorry, I know I'm rambling a bit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.15,
      "end_seconds": 33.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "Any regular medication at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 34.15,
      "end_seconds": 38.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "well, no, nothing at the the moment"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.87,
      "end_seconds": 42.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Has this been going on for long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 44.47,
      "end_seconds": 46.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "Probably about a month. Yeah."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 47.58,
      "end_seconds": 53.2,
      "duration_seconds": 5.62,
      "text": "Is it there all the time or does it come and go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.78,
      "end_seconds": 55.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "Honestly, all the time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 57.78,
      "end_seconds": 60.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Is there something that settles it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.43,
      "end_seconds": 68.44,
      "duration_seconds": 6.01,
      "text": "sorry, what was I saying, it it settles a little with moisturiser"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 69.45,
      "end_seconds": 73.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "Is it a lot or only a little?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 74.81,
      "end_seconds": 78.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "pretty severe, if I'm being honest"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.9,
      "end_seconds": 81.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "does anything else come with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.8,
      "end_seconds": 94.75,
      "duration_seconds": 12.95,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get a bit of redness as well. The bit of redness? That's been for about two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 96.69,
      "end_seconds": 99.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "any spreading, fever or blisters at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 100.99,
      "end_seconds": 103.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "None of those, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.91,
      "end_seconds": 108.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "Any pins and needles or loss of strength anywhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 113.88,
      "end_seconds": 115.41,
      "duration_seconds": 1.53,
      "text": "Nothing odd there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.05,
      "end_seconds": 130.47,
      "duration_seconds": 1.42,
      "text": "any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.52,
      "end_seconds": 132.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.08,
      "text": "no, never"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.66,
      "end_seconds": 138.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 141.5,
      "end_seconds": 143.1,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "No, no conditions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.38,
      "end_seconds": 164.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "Are there any allergies I should be aware of?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 166.29,
      "end_seconds": 170.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.63,
      "text": "Plasters. I come out in... well, a red itchy rash."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.57,
      "end_seconds": 173.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.24,
      "text": "do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.26,
      "end_seconds": 179.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "I smoke roughly a pack every two days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.86,
      "end_seconds": 182.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.79,
      "text": "How are your meals?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 183.68,
      "end_seconds": 187.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "I grab fast food at lunch most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.45,
      "end_seconds": 191.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "Are you on your own at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 192.88,
      "end_seconds": 195.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 197.24,
      "end_seconds": 200.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "what do you do during the day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 200.91,
      "end_seconds": 204.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "I look after my grandchildren most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.72,
      "end_seconds": 207.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "I'll just record a a few vital signs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.36,
      "end_seconds": 223.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Sit still for a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.27,
      "end_seconds": 248.47,
      "duration_seconds": 9.2,
      "text": "Okay: heart rate 72, SpO2 98 percent on room air, temp 36.8 degrees. And And BP is 126 over 70."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 250.12,
      "end_seconds": 253.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "Okay, time for me to examine you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.44,
      "end_seconds": 257.18,
      "duration_seconds": 1.74,
      "text": "Let me feel here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.13,
      "end_seconds": 281.47,
      "duration_seconds": 6.34,
      "text": "There's a neat red patch where the watch strap sits, with a little scaling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.61,
      "end_seconds": 285.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "Please sit back down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 300.1,
      "end_seconds": 307.32,
      "duration_seconds": 7.22,
      "text": "Putting it all together, this looks most like mild contact dermatitis from the watch strap."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 308.39,
      "end_seconds": 311.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "Is there something to worry about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 315.61,
      "end_seconds": 335.42,
      "duration_seconds": 19.81,
      "text": "I understand the worry at the moment I'd say it's mild contact dermatitis from the watch strap, and we'll watch how it goes stop me if I've got anything wrong you've had an itchy patch on your wrist for about a month, severe, and no spreading or fever"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 337.1,
      "end_seconds": 339.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "That's what happened, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 354.17,
      "end_seconds": 371.89,
      "duration_seconds": 17.72,
      "text": "The The treatment will be hydrocortisone cream, 1%, once a day, one week. That's for contact dermatitis. Stop wearing that strap and keep the skin moisturised. See me again if it has not cleared in two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 373.34,
      "end_seconds": 375.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "I can manage that"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 376.98,
      "end_seconds": 381.17,
      "duration_seconds": 4.19,
      "text": "So, that's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 382.86,
      "end_seconds": 385.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "I think I understand everything. Thanks."
    }
